ChildVault_recoverFailedCcipSend
├── when no CCIP send recovery exists
│   └── it should revert with BaseVault__NoPendingRecovery
├── when epoch withdraw getFee reverts
│   ├── it should store CCIP send recovery
│   └── it should emit CcipSendRecoveryStored
├── when epoch withdraw ccipSend reverts
│   └── it should store CCIP send recovery
├── when rebalance getFee reverts
│   └── it should store CCIP send recovery
├── when retry succeeds
│   ├── it should clear recovery and bridge USDC
│   └── it should emit CcipSendRecoveryCleared
├── when retry fails
│   └── it should revert and preserve recovery
├── when CCIP send recovery is pending
│   └── it should block later sends without overwriting recovery
└── when recovery is cleared
    └── it should allow a later different send type
